                <pb facs="0955" n="843" xml:id="pg843"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 892.001 /4.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">President Taft to the
                            King of Siam.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >The White House</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1910-10-25"><hi rendition="#italic">October 25,
                        1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I beg to offer to Your Majesty the expression of the deep sympathy of the
                    Government and people of the United States in the loss sustained by Siam in the
                    death of His Late Majesty King Chulalongkorn, and my good wishes for the
                    prosperity and happiness of the Siamese people under your reign.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wm. H. Taft.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
